# `lean/TheoriaLean.lean` is a byte-reproducible generated artefact, and a test
# asserts it equals what the generator currently emits. A CRLF translation on
# checkout would make that test machine-dependent on any clone with
# core.autocrlf=true. Same reasoning as engine-rig/.gitattributes; everything
# under theory-compiler/ stays LF in the working copy.
* text eol=lf
